        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE A TORSO. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire limbs and tattoos to get better at tennis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824780/extras/e4c976b49e559194799ed3201ea81350.poster.avif?t=1761303956\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824780/extras/e4c976b49e559194799ed3201ea81350.webm?t=1761303956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824780/extras/e4c976b49e559194799ed3201ea81350.mp4?t=1761303956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TORSO TENNIS is a grid-based action roguelike with autobattler-inspired shop and synergy systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  💪 <strong>Acquire Limbs:</strong> Buy them, upgrade them, and YOINK them from defeated opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖋️<strong>Get Horrible Tattoos:</strong> passive boosts that alter your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎾<strong>Break the Game</strong>: become a Tennis God.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Builds To Try:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn CRITTERS that serve tennis balls, upgrade them to max capacity for an extremely offensive build that showers your opponent with tennis balls.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a debuff build by removing the limbs from your opponent and throwing TRASH onto their court.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go full Defense mode with a DINO build, protect your court with SHELLS, then find an opening to unleash a full clip of tennis balls.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE A TORSO. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire limbs and tattoos to get better at tennis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824780/extras/e4c976b49e559194799ed3201ea81350.poster.avif?t=1761303956\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824780/extras/e4c976b49e559194799ed3201ea81350.webm?t=1761303956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824780/extras/e4c976b49e559194799ed3201ea81350.mp4?t=1761303956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TORSO TENNIS is a grid-based action roguelike with autobattler-inspired shop and synergy systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  💪 <strong>Acquire Limbs:</strong> Buy them, upgrade them, and YOINK them from defeated opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖋️<strong>Get Horrible Tattoos:</strong> passive boosts that alter your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎾<strong>Break the Game</strong>: become a Tennis God.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Builds To Try:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn CRITTERS that serve tennis balls, upgrade them to max capacity for an extremely offensive build that showers your opponent with tennis balls.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a debuff build by removing the limbs from your opponent and throwing TRASH onto their court.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go full Defense mode with a DINO build, protect your court with SHELLS, then find an opening to unleash a full clip of tennis balls.</p></li></ul>",
